cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "scada-fault-bench: an open benchmark for fault detection in wind and PV SCADA data"
abstract: >-
  Faults with a known time, device and size are injected into clean stretches of open wind and PV datasets in the scada-schema
  format; detectors are scored by one evaluation (events, delay, false alarms, sensitivity to fault size) with block-bootstrap
  confidence intervals, and on real labelled faults of CARE to Compare. The injected faults are a signal-level model; results
  describe this benchmark only.
authors:
